 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nNordiska Verktyg AB                                     MASTER SERVICES\nKungsgatan 8, 111 43 Stockholm, Sweden                    AGREEMENT\nMomsreg.nr: SE798894025701\n\nFROM                                                             FAKTURERAS TILL\nNordiska Verktyg AB                                              Mälardalen Kemi AB\nKungsgatan 8                                                     Kungsgatan 8\n111 43 Stockholm                                                 111 43 Stockholm\nSweden                                                           Sweden\nVAT: SE798894025701\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026-01-10 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Nordiska Verktyg AB, with its registered office at Kungsgatan 8, Stockholm\n(\"Party A\"), and Mälardalen Kemi AB, with its registered office at Kungsgatan 8, Stockholm (\"Party\nB\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A  Nordiska Verktyg AB / Anna Söderberg\nParty B  Mälardalen Kemi AB / Erik Lindqvist\nDate     2026-01-10",
